# Claude Code's per-machine permission allowlist. Not shared config: it grows
# every session, and it records approved commands verbatim — which means any
# secret passed on a command line (CRON_SECRET in a curl header, say) ends up
# in it. .claude/launch.json is real project config and stays tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

